{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZJFkweTnw82PfdwdN4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AnyDecisionModel puts six backends behind one Swift session API, so the same questions can run on a local model or a hosted service. A DecisionSession holds a single state, either text or JSON, and every question is asked about that state. Questions are independent, meaning an answer never becomes input to a later one, and several can be sent together as a batch through decide(_:). The pattern follows Foundation Models and AnyLanguageModel, which the authors note will look familiar to users of either.\n\nFour of the backends run on the device. MLX runs a small language model on Apple silicon, and a separate MLX backend runs models with their own trained decision head, such as Cloudflare's Clef. Core AI does the same as MLX with a Core AI model on macOS 27 and iOS 27, and llama.cpp reads decisions from a local GGUF model through llama.swift. The other two call out to a server. Jev works through TypeSafe's System One API, or any server that implements it, such as Kev, and Ollama calls a System One decision model on a local Ollama server or in Ollama's cloud. Ollama needs version 0.35.0 or later, or 0.40.5 or later for cloud models.\n\nPackage traits control what a project pulls in. Without any trait, the package has no third-party dependencies and provides the core types plus the Jev and Ollama backends, which also build on Linux. The MLX, CoreAI and Llama traits switch on the local backends. Each comes with toolchain requirements: the MLX build tasks use Xcode's Swift 6.4 or later and the Metal toolchain, and Core AI needs Xcode 27 and an OS 27 runtime.\n\nThe package is at version 0.6.0, and the authors invite reports on what works and what doesn't."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1191,"cache_read_input_tokens":11824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1191},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd18c5f8-2302-4498-9962-d47d36bcbea1","uuid":"a1397757-f30c-4133-b30e-0a62ff67a245","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:34:56.895Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZJFWp95e1kVGx7p7Qt"}
